%
O00013 (IF, CHC VS NGC MACRO)

(#6198 = 1000000 ON NGC) 
(#6198, SET. 198, = 235, SCREEN COLOR, ON CHC) 

IF [ #6198 EQ 1000000 ] GOTO10 (NGC CODE) 

GOTO20 (CHC CODE) 

M30 

N10 (NGC CODE, NEXT GEN CONTROL) 
#3000= 1 (NGC) 

N20 (CHC CODE, CLASSIC HAAS CONTROL) 
